  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Landscapes in Eastern Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to: increase investments in climate-smart agriculture, sustainable agriculture and clean energy; reduce emissions from deforestation and forest degradation; and enhance the livelihoods and resilience of smallholders to climate shocks.

&#x2022; The Project has a holistic approach to sustainable landscapes in both forested lands and degraded areas at a large scale.
&#x2022; The Project adapts fit-for-purpose financing to the type of activities promoted (not-for-profit/for-profit).
&#x2022; The Project demonstrates the case for private sector and public sector involvement in forestry projects.
&#x2022; The Project innovatively channels institutional investors&#x2019; money into Madagascar which is a least developed country.</narrative>
  </description>
